{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChK6ykL1QFXPDEbqpkZX1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed it in `django/contrib/auth/migrations/0011_update_proxy_permissions.py`. The existing `auth_tests.test_migrations` tests all pass (8 of 8). I didn't add a test for the duplicate-permission case itself, so that path hasn't been run here.\n\n**Cause:** the migration moves each proxy model's permissions from the concrete model's content type to the proxy's own. If a permission with the same codename already exists for the proxy's content type, the update breaks the `(content_type_id, codename)` unique constraint. That happens, for example, when a model was deleted and recreated as a proxy, and it raised the `IntegrityError` from the report.\n\n**Fix:** this follows the same approach Django took upstream for this bug.\n- Each proxy model's permission update now runs inside its own `transaction.atomic()` block.\n- If that update raises `IntegrityError`, only that block is rolled back. The migration prints a warning to stdout naming the old and new content types and the permission query, telling the user to check those permissions by hand, and then moves on to the next model.\n- The rest of the migration still completes, and reversing it goes through the same code, so it is covered too.\n\nThe trade-off is that permissions which clash are left where they were rather than merged or deleted. That's why the warning asks for a manual check."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":160,"cache_read_input_tokens":21637,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":160},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c09d4cb-f2d9-405f-b24f-2c4589190a2b","uuid":"3f1aa65c-2402-43b5-a5ce-a3f985303e46","timestamp":"2026-11-23T02:53:34.687Z","request_id":"req_011ChK6ykB5cH5i6AK3gNXgs"}
